    "problems": "The Refusal Pairs baseline is not shown with benign-prompt refusal or utility measurements. The results are VLM-specific and use toxicity and ASR metrics; uncertainty estimates are not reported.",
    "rows_left_out": "ASTRA results in Tables 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, and 8, including benign utility and transfer results, were left out because they evaluate the paper's distinct image-attribution-based adaptive defense, not the refusal-pair steering direction. Jailbreak Templates comparator values were also omitted because they do not use refusal semantics.",
